{
  "slug": "autoresearch-ai-plugin",
  "name": "Autoresearch Ai Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Autonomous experiment loop for Claude Code. Run an endless optimize-measure-keep/discard cycle on any optimization target: LLM training loss, test speed, bundle size, build time, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 command** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `autoresearch` (Autonomous experiment loop: edit code, commit, run benchmark, extract metrics, keep improvements or revert, repeat forever), `autoresearch-ml` (Autonomous LLM training optimization with GPU support)\n- **Agents** (1): `autoresearch-orchestrator` (Use this agent to run an autoresearch experiment session end-to-end — setup, baseline, and a batch of edit→measure→keep/discard…)\n- **Commands** (1): `run-autoresearch` (Run an autonomous experiment loop via the Autoresearch Orchestrator agent)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install autoresearch-ai-plugin@claude-community` from `proyecto26/autoresearch-ai-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
